* official Analog Canvas netlist; PDK X cards rewritten by convert.py
.model nch nmos
.model pch pmos

.subckt dut VDD VSS VIN VOUT VERR VB1 VREF VB2 nb pb VB3
M1 VX1 VEA VIN VDD pch l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M10 VEA VB3 net4 VDD pch l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
